# GO-2026-5932: golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is unmaintained / unsafe by design.
# Module-level advisory with NO fixed version — it flags every consumer of the
# x/crypto module regardless of which packages are imported. This repo does not
# import x/crypto/openpgp anywhere (grep the tree), and the call-graph-aware
# govulncheck gate (make vuln, CI "Vulnerability scan") remains the
# authoritative reachability check and stays green. Remove this entry if
# openpgp is ever imported or the advisory gains a fixed version.
GO-2026-5932
